Right triangle ABC is shown. What is the value of \tan A?
A. \frac{\sqrt{3}}{54}
B. \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}
C. \sqrt{3}
D. 27\sqrt{3}

The perimeter of an isosceles right triangle is 18 + 18\sqrt{2} inches. What is the length, in inches, of the hypotenuse of this triangle?
A. 9
